<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistan to auction bonds worth 13.065 bln rupees.</title>
<headline>Pakistan to auction bonds worth 13.065 bln rupees.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1996-10-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The State (central) Bank of Pakistan on Sunday invited bids for the auction of six-month Short-Term Federal Bonds worth 13.065 billion rupees.</p>
<p>It said bids would be opened on Tuesday and the results would be announced on Wednesday, with a pre-auction target set at 13.065 billion rupees.</p>
<p>-- Karachi newsroom 9221-5685192</p>
</text>
